    "slug": "super-ship",
    "name": "super-ship",
    "icon": "rocket_launch",
    "description": "Chains the drift audit into the ship flow for structural work. Runs the full audit first, fixes the broken and stale findings it surfaces, then ships the combined result: full verify, merge into main, push, CI watched to green, and the live site proven rendering. Gap findings and new-validator recommendations are reported as follow-ups, never built mid-ship.",
