    "description": "Saves work in progress to a remote branch as a safety net, then stays on that branch so work continues. It never touches main and never deploys: if invoked on main it moves the work to a new branch first, because pushing main publishes the site. A quick lint runs before the push and failures are flagged without blocking the backup.",
