    "description": "The one-time path from a green private repo to a live public product: the Vercel projects, the placeholder URL becoming real, the parked uptime cron waking up, the npm Trusted Publishing registration this repo does not yet have, the first publish, and the wiring the chat and analytics wait on. Ordered so nothing ships pointing at a thing that does not exist yet.",
