    "description": "Audits a component or page against WCAG 2.1 AA criteria. Checks semantic HTML, ARIA usage, keyboard navigation, focus styles, and colour contrast via both source code analysis and live screenshots. Reports file and line-level findings with WCAG criterion and severity.",
